# Code conventions

## Structure

```
src/content/          # typed data only
src/components/shared/
src/components/motion/   # GSAP client components
src/components/bento/    # grid layouts (reuse tiles in main page)
src/app/                 # routes; prefer one main `/` when preview ends
```

## TypeScript & React

- Prefer **server components** for static sections; `"use client"` only for Framer/GSAP/DOM hooks
- Export types next to content (`ExperienceRole`, etc.)
- No `any`; no empty catch blocks
- Import alias `@/` for all internal paths

## Styling

- Tailwind only, no inline styles except rare GSAP transforms
- Reuse tokens from `globals.css`; don’t introduce second color systems

## Changes

- **Minimal diffs:** don’t refactor unrelated files when editing copy (touch `src/content/` only)
- Run `npm run build` after structural/route changes
- Don’t commit secrets, `.env`, or user resume PDFs from Downloads

## Content edits

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: update data
// src/content/experience.ts

// ❌ BAD: hardcoded job bullets in page.tsx
```
